title: Winner
---
???: Young cab man, it seems I've missed the last bus home. Can you pick me up at the West Office?
-> Sure.
    <<jump Tutorial>>
-> I'll be there
    <<jump Tutorial>>
===

title: Tutorial
---
You: [Tutorial, don't skip these dialogues, you can follow along the steps while the dialogue box is still on]
You: I should press [M] to open the map.
You: The Green Dot is where the passenger currently is.
You: I can use [Scroll Wheel] to zoom in on the map.
You: Now that I have enough info, I can press [Left Shift] to start the car.
You: [Left Shift] will also stop the car if it is currently moving.
You: Use [A or D] to turn on blinker, when I approach an intersection with my either blinker on, I will turn into that lane if I can.
You: I can also press [W] to cancel blinker.
You: Futhermore, I can press [S] to turn my car around.
You: To look around in the car, move the mouse to the very edge of the screen.
You: Remember, when you arrive at the passenger, press [E] to pick them up.
You: Good luck out there!
===

title: PhoneCall
---
You: What do I want to do...?
-> Review tutorial
    <<jump Tutorial>>
-> Call passenger
    ???: Hi, are you here yet? Press [E] When you get here, i'll come out to you.
    You: Okay.
===

title: InTheCar
---
???: Thank you for picking me up, I am Paul.
You: Hello Paul. So, where to?
Paul: Please take me to my house at the East Suburb.
Paul: You can get there by taking the highway.
You: We'll head there right away, sir.
You: [The East Suburb is far away, I should zoom out all the way from the map]
===

title: Bye
---
Paul: We've arrived? Thank you young man. May your night be pleasant.
You: Bye Paul! Give me a call if you need a ride okay.

===